OL,3,GNEWSAFire that killed two sisters was
OL,4,Astarted by candles in flat below
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire which killed two sisters in
OL,7,FAberdeen was started by candles in the
OL,8,Fflat below and spread rapidly, an
OL,9,Finvestigation has found.
OL,11,FShikshya and Aanchal Subedi, who were
OL,12,F24 and 28, died at the block in the
OL,13,Fcity's Back Hilton Road in January
OL,14,F2024. A joint police and fire
OL,15,Finvestigation was launched into the
OL,16,Fblaze, but there were no suspicious
OL,17,Fcircumstances found.
OL,19,FIt was already known the fire had
OL,20,Fspread from a neighbouring flat.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
