OL,3,GNEWSAFire that killed two sisters was
OL,4,Astarted by candles in flat below
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,F(SFRS) incident report - which has now
OL,8,Fbeen obtained by BBC Scotland News
OL,9,Fthrough a Freedom of Information (FoI)
OL,10,Frequest - reveals that the fire was
OL,11,Fstarted by candles.
